#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:7
msgid "Choose a Hook, Stage, or Callback"
msgstr "Hook、Stage、Callbackを選ぶ"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:9
msgid ""
"The prerequisite is wanting to add observation or post-processing to an "
"existing execution path."
msgstr "前提は、既存の実行経路に観測や後処理を追加したいことです。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "What you'll be able to do"
msgstr "このページでできるようになること"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:13
msgid ""
"By the end of this page, you'll be able to distinguish Hooks that change "
"data, Stages that replace execution units, and Callbacks that observe "
"events."
msgstr "このページを終えると、データを変更するHook、実行単位を置き換えるStage、観測するCallbackを区別できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:16
msgid ""
"See the [optimization components](../concepts/index.md) index; for a "
"custom contract, continue to [Custom components](custom_components.md)."
msgstr ""
"構成要素の索引は [最適化の構成要素](../concepts/index.md) で、独自の契約が必要なら "
"[独自Component](custom_components.md) に進みます。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:18
msgid "Compare the boundaries"
msgstr "境界を比較する"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Mechanism"
msgstr "手段"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Execution point"
msgstr "実行時点"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Can change state?"
msgstr "状態変更の可否"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Suitable uses"
msgstr "適した用途"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "`with_post`"
msgstr "`with_post`"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Post-process an existing Operator's output"
msgstr "既存Operatorの出力を後処理する"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "After Crossover or Mutation"
msgstr "CrossoverまたはMutationの後"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Can change candidates through its return value"
msgstr "戻り値で候補を変更できる"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Repair, rounding, and bounding"
msgstr "修復、丸め、範囲内への変換"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "`with_post_fit`"
msgstr "`with_post_fit`"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Process after a Surrogate fit"
msgstr "Surrogateのfit後に処理する"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "After `fit()`"
msgstr "`fit()` の後"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Can update the model or external state in the Hook"
msgstr "Hookの処理でモデルや外部状態を更新できる"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Fit records and model post-processing"
msgstr "fit記録、モデル後処理"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "`Stage`"
msgstr "`Stage`"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Implement or replace a compatibility execution unit"
msgstr "互換実行単位を実装または置換する"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "At a Stage position in the Pipeline"
msgstr "Pipeline内のStage位置"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Can update state by returning an `OptimizationState`"
msgstr "`OptimizationState` を返して状態を更新できる"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Add generation processing and swap a Stage"
msgstr "世代処理の追加、Stage差替え"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "`CallbackManager`"
msgstr "`CallbackManager`"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Observe events"
msgstr "イベントを観測する"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "When a registered Event fires"
msgstr "登録したEventの発火時"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "`event.ctx` is read-only; do not use it to replace Pipeline input"
msgstr "`event.ctx` は読み取り用で、Pipeline入力の置換には使わない"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:10
msgid "Logging, history, and condition checks"
msgstr "ログ、履歴、条件判断"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:27
msgid "Change data with a Hook"
msgstr "Hookでデータを変更する"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:29
msgid ""
"To change an Operator's candidate array, use `with_post()` rather than "
"`CallbackManager`. `with_post()` returns a copy with the Hook added "
"without modifying the original instance."
msgstr ""
"Operatorの候補配列を実際に変えるなら、`CallbackManager` ではなく `with_post()` を使います。 "
"`with_post()` は元のインスタンスを変更せず、Hookを追加したコピーを返します。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:44
msgid ""
"For post-processing after a Surrogate fit, pass `fn(train_x, train_y, "
"ctx) -> None` to `with_post_fit()`. See the [Surrogate "
"concept](../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate.md) for the contract "
"used by this Hook."
msgstr ""
"Surrogateのfit後処理は、`fn(train_x, train_y, ctx) -> None` を `with_post_fit()`"
" に渡します。 このHookを使う具体的な契約は "
"[Surrogateの概念](../concepts/surrogate_modeling/surrogate.md) を参照してください。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:47
msgid "Replace an execution unit with a Stage"
msgstr "Stageで実行単位を置き換える"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:49
msgid ""
"`Stage` is the compatibility boundary `execute(state) -> state`. Return a"
" new State with `state.replace()` when updating state. It is not the "
"boundary for implementing a structured Framework Component or Compiler "
"directly; for that, see [Framework "
"extensions](../framework/extensions.md)."
msgstr ""
"`Stage` は `execute(state) -> state` の互換性用境界です。 状態を更新するときは "
"`state.replace()` で新しいStateを返します。 "
"構造化FrameworkのComponentやCompilerを直接実装する境界ではないため、それが必要なら "
"[フレームワーク拡張](../framework/extensions.md) を参照します。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:65
msgid ""
"See the [Stage concept](../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md) for "
"Pipeline composition and the Stage contract."
msgstr ""
"Pipelineの構成とStageの契約は "
"[Stageの概念](../concepts/observation_and_state/stage.md) に委ねます。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:67
msgid "Observe with a Callback"
msgstr "Callbackで観測する"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:69
msgid ""
"`CallbackManager.register()` registers a function that receives an Event "
"type and `event`. The `event.ctx` read by the handler is the public read "
"boundary for generation and evaluation counts."
msgstr ""
"`CallbackManager.register()` は、Event型と `event` を受け取る関数を登録します。 ハンドラから読む "
"`event.ctx` は、世代や評価回数などの公開された読み取り境界です。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:101
msgid ""
"Replacing candidate arrays or rewriting state is outside a Callback's "
"responsibility. Use Callbacks for event observation, logging, and "
"recording history."
msgstr ""
"候補配列を差し替える、または状態を書き換える処理はCallbackの責務ではありません。 "
"Callbackはイベントの観測、ログ、履歴の記録に使います。"

#: ../../tutorials/interface_hooks.md:104
msgid ""
"Use [Custom components](custom_components.md) when you need to implement "
"a component contract, and see [Framework "
"extensions](../framework/extensions.md) when changing the contract or "
"Runtime itself."
msgstr ""
"独自Componentの契約を実装する必要があるときは [独自Component](custom_components.md) "
"を使い、契約やRuntimeそのものを変更するときは [フレームワーク拡張](../framework/extensions.md) "
"を参照してください。"

